ment?
2. What evidence would instead support that balance recovery and payment timi=
ng identify self-cure?
3. How do we rule out that past contact creates the apparent cure?

This has returned because the previous answer was useful but not strong enoug=
h to become a standing rule. Use February 2021 as the new evidence point rath=
er than recycling the earlier conclusion. Please work towards which accounts =
can receive a light-touch reminder and which need an agent. A useful output w=
